---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import styles from '../styles/legal.module.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Report an Error | WitrQuran"
  description="Found something that is not working correctly on WitrQuran? Help us fix it."
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class={styles.pageContainer}>
    <nav class={styles.breadcrumb} aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Report an Error</span>
    </nav>

    <header class={styles.header}>
      <h1 class={styles.title}>Report an Error</h1>
    </header>

    <div class={styles.content}>
      <p>Found something that is not working correctly on WitrQuran?</p>

      <p>Help us fix it.</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is built to provide a simple fast and uninterrupted Quran listening experience. If you find a technical problem an incorrect Surah issue with audio playback or anything else that does not work as expected please report it to us.</p>

      <h2>What Can You Report</h2>

      <p>You can report issues such as:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Audio not playing</li>
        <li>Audio stopping unexpectedly</li>
        <li>Incorrect playback</li>
        <li>Surah or verse playback issues</li>
        <li>Website loading problems</li>
        <li>Broken buttons or controls</li>
        <li>Mobile or desktop display issues</li>
        <li>Incorrect website behavior</li>
        <li>Any other technical issue you notice</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Report the Issue</h2>

      <p>Please use our external reporting form to submit your report.</p>

      <p><a href="https://witrfaruk.vercel.app?utm_source" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>Report an Error</strong></a></p>

      <p>The report will be handled through the external reporting system rather than directly inside WitrQuran.</p>

      <h2>What to Include</h2>

      <p>To help us understand and fix the problem please provide:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>A short description of the issue</li>
        <li>What you were trying to do</li>
        <li>What happened</li>
        <li>The device or browser you were using if relevant</li>
        <li>A screenshot or other useful information if necessary</li>
        <li>Your email address if you want a response</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Please do not submit passwords financial information or other sensitive personal information in an error report.</p>

      <h2>What Happens After You Report</h2>

      <p>We will review the information you provide and investigate the reported issue</p>

      <p>If additional information is required we may contact you using the email address you provided</p>

      <p>Information submitted for an error report is used to investigate and resolve the reported issue and is not intended to be permanently retained</p>

      <p>Once the issue has been addressed the submitted report may be deleted</p>

      <h2>Thank You</h2>

      <p>Every useful report helps us make WitrQuran better</p>

      <p>WitrQuran is an open source project created to make Quran listening simpler for everyone by the will of Allah SWT</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
